<h1>Week 31</h1>

<p><strong>From:</strong> Lana</p>
<p><strong>Artist:</strong> Voice of the Beehive</p>
<p><strong>Album:</strong> <em>Honey Lingers</em></p>

<p>Kayla,</p>

<p>
This week I picked <em>Honey Lingers</em> by Voice of the Beehive.
</p>

<p>
I had this on cassette. When you were a baby this is what we listened to when we were driving around. Just the two of us be-bopping along.
</p>

<p>
This whole album is just pretty and probably leaning a girl power vibe.
</p>

<p>
I can picture us so clearly and you just a tiny little baby.
</p>

<p>
I bought the album for “Monsters &amp; Angels.” I still like it. And I also liked “Adonis Blue” and “Look at Me.”
</p>

<p>
But the song I love the most is “Beauty to My Eyes.” That is my love letter to you.
</p>

<p>
I can remember almost weeping when this song came on because I loved you so much. I couldn’t believe how amazing you were and what a lucky person I was to have you in my life.
</p>

<p>
And you were just so beautiful and perfect.
</p>

<p>
I am not sure if you will like this one. It’s a little pop-ish for me, but the memory of that time makes it a list maker for me.
</p>

<p>
Thank you for being in my life. 🥰🥰🥰
</p>

<p>
Mom
</p>

